    53	**Subduction is now a public, independent repo** (106 stars, created 2025-07-18, pushed daily).
    54	
    55	- Peer-to-peer sync for hash-linked data; Sedimentree for history sharding; explicitly **encryption-friendly — syncs encrypted partitions without decrypting**; transports WebSocket, HTTP long-poll, **Iroh/QUIC**. https://github.com/inkandswitch/subduction
    56	- **Sedimentree = depth-based partitioning by leading-zero-byte count of a BLAKE3 digest.** Content-oblivious, deterministic strata. https://github.com/inkandswitch/subduction/blob/main/design/sedimentree.md
